WEBVTT

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:30.680
Guns on!

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:29.370
A strange flying object suddenly appeared from the other side of the universe.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.090
The object is a space disc.

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:37.780
The disc is one of the solar system's stars.

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:39.180
It's moving towards the Earth.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:44.850
The disc's proximity was quickly reflected on the Earth's radar.

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:50.280
An unknown object is approaching.

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:51.820
Get ready to attack!

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:54.000
Get ready to attack!

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:03.500
Make it clear the purpose of the invasion.

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:08.300
If you don't respond, the main force will attack.

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:12.070
Respond! Respond!

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:24.120
All units, attack! Respond! Respond!

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:36.720
It is King Hiroshima, who has come to conquer the Earth from the far side of the universe!

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:39.320
Soldiers, see the power of King Hiroshima!

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:46.060
Yes, sir!

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:14.750
The space disk sunk into the ocean of the Pacific Ocean

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:17.160
The moonlit day passed without showing its true form

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:18.560
People forgot about it

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:24.090
A few months later, a sea incident occurred

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:26.230
